Apple's latest low-cost iPhone launched yesterday, and we picked up the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-17e/">iPhone 17e</a> to see how it compares to the iPhone 16e that came before it, and how it measures up to the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-17/">iPhone 17</a> lineup.<br/>
<br/>
